5e-916a5db389ef","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"法人から個人にお金を貸すってやつかな","ts":"1629177054.024100","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1629177063.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4wZJV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8E94EFFB-D9E7-4784-B3FF-A5CEBFB15C92","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"会計監査必須の国はそれなりに厳しいくなりますからね。日本はなぜか監査必須じゃないんですよね。","ts":"1629176074.023000","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1629176087.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i1n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba5c5306-cd3b-4a4b-9706-fe9818571a37","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"日本はその産業構造上やや中小企業を優遇しすぎてるところがあるとは思う。そのせいで国際競争力を削がれているともいうし、災害等からの復帰が速いとも考えてる。","ts":"1629176047.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BE9g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9461b6e-9b90-44ad-936e-12f085186881","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁ国ごとにテクニック違うからなぁ。","ts":"1629175983.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7+w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55AF8AEA-8C59-411D-B712-2E60BE00A114","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"日本だと、会社から貸付するという技がよく使われますね","ts":"1629175912.020200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MrB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81acfbad-5fb7-4472-a0f3-95096768b852","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"hoC","ts":"1629175891.019500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3cB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C11AEC7D-7C36-4614-BDD7-3BEC84FC5E09","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"日本の税理士、中小企業の社長の節税対策が仕事みたいなところがあるからなぁ","ts