k":"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/programs/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/federal-government-budgets/income-sprinkling/frequently-asked-questions-income-sprinkling.html","text":"Frequently asked questions - Income sprinkling","blocks":null,"service_name":"canada.ca","service_icon":"https://www.canada.ca/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/programs/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/federal-government-budgets/income-sprinkling/frequently-asked-questions-income-sprinkling.html","original_url":"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/programs/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/federal-government-budgets/income-sprinkling/frequently-asked-questions-income-sprinkling.html"}],"edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1629174994.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pVr9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4cbfdd8-51e1-42fc-afd1-131616adc864","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"tax on split income","ts":"1629174956.015800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"14P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2321688e-b8b7-4908-8e06-efa4febf0b3b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"そしてTOSIまわりがめちゃくちゃ厳しい上に法律が曖昧で難しい的な感じです","ts":"1629174941.015500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ljLr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4df87645-cbf1-4cba-9b65-f4293f7e629e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"なんというか、こっちで調べたことに対して、可能か不可能か、そのやり方はどうだ、みたいな感じでしか使えないぽいです","ts":"1629174847.014800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B+R5A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59ab27ab-67b6-43a1-9045-ae7adaaba559","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"彼らもビジネスだから。","ts":"1629174690.013400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WG1Ij"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1620bf53-f783-4ccb-a1ac-4720fb9b06b6","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"なるほど。ふんわりとは聞けないのか。","ts":"1629174674.013200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d0d9b0d-6e3b-42e9-a1f7-51525a67cfeb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"会計士います! 正確にいうと、こっちで調査してある程度結論を出して、それから30分とかの枠で一気に質問相談する的な流れです","ts":"1629174645.012600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"70hEi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59cf6e82-e58b-4e06-b3ca-9ee3f4c8642c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"会社で家買うのは調べたんですが、個人で買うと節税効果がすごいけど会社だとそのあたりの控除が全然なくてだいぶ高いみたいな話もあってよくわからなくなって挫折しました","ts":"1629174604.011800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cud"}]},{"client_msg_id":"699bf131-8671-45fa-8364-e35a1a85d5d2","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"税制は会計士にきけないの? 契約外?","ts":"1629174470.011000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aauF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4131daa9-49a8-49b6-bdad-541ba2ab07ca","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あと税制的に、会社で家とかマンション買って、それを役員・従業員に有料で貸し出すっていうテクもあるらしい。","ts":"1629174401.010400","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1629174411.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ute"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56f44190-7257-4162-b2ea-d586a88f3959","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"日本には配偶者控除から抜けない範囲で最大のキリの良い数字で8万っていうのが…","ts":"1629174273.009500","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1629174329.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jiS="}]},{"client_msg_id":"78779866-3179-4633-b7a1-dba6324031a1","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"結局どうするのがいいのかなー的な。むずすぎる・・・","ts":"1629174197.008800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eg7k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3922b1d6-13dd-450d-b897-71c87902c9ae","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"今すぐ手元に個人として使える現金が必要かというと全然必要ではないので、給料ほぼなしでもいいんですが、家を買いたいので個人の方に収入がある方がよく、かつ給料出しすぎると結局法人つくった節税メリットを失うので、","ts":"1629174189.008400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XAmsX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4b16d0b-96b5-46bd-a235-db9d35af68f6","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"今年は僕はいまのところ1~8月現在ずっと仕事していて、嫁は自社に対しては1~3月末まで仕事、そして二人とも会社のownerという立ち位置","ts":"1629174135.007000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hU/vl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49adaf81-3f36-4d15-a9cf-aa00977a8827","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"そろそろ自分と嫁の給料を出さないといけないんですが、どのくらいの金額をどんな風に払うのがいいか全然分からず、調査してます","ts":"1629174081.005700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3FL"}]}]
